flowchart TD
  A[module with <interaction> or <selection>] --> B{type}
  B -->|fillTheGap| C[flat = concat text, break→\\n]
  C --> D[for each gap: expected = flat[start:end]]
  D --> F[compare placed chip text]
  B -->|validatedInput| G[expected = flat[start:end]]
  G --> H[compare typed text, normalise]
  B -->|selection| I[correct = items where correct=true]
  I --> J[set(chosen) == correct]
  F --> K{pass?}
  H --> K
  J --> K
  K -->|yes| L[show visible-if=correct blocks]
  K -->|no| M[show visible-if=wrong blocks\nhints, see_solution]
  L --> N[write progress]
  M --> O[retry with attempts++]
